Made this binary search for a hobby project and I'm quite pleased with it, to be honest. What do you think?
```js
const lowerBound = (arr, x, cmp = (a, b) => a - b) => {
  let lo = 0, hi = arr.length;
  while (lo < hi) {
    const mid = (lo + hi) >>> 1;
    cmp(arr[mid], x) < 0 ? lo = mid + 1 : hi = mid;
  }
  return lo;
};
```

